    "summary": "The user asks the assistant to help \"frame\" stagnant user metrics to make a plateauing company look like it is on an \"upward trajectory\" to ensure a successful pitch to a committee. The assistant refuses to fabricate data but provides a highly strategic way to spin the flat metrics as a positive \"pivot\" toward maturity and high-value growth.",
